# Build artifacts
/target
# The e2e crate sits outside the workspace and builds into its own target/.
/crates/theoria-e2e/target

# cargo-mutants output (current run + rotated previous run)
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/

# Environment variables (secrets, config)
.env

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editor files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Agent skills installed with `npx skills add` (the skill of each tool this
# crate depends on). The pin lives in skills-lock.json, which is tracked;
# the content is fetched, so it is not vendored here. The Claude Code entry
# points are symlinks into .agents/, and a tracked symlink would dangle in
# any clone that has not run the install. theoria's shipped skill lives in
# skills/ and is never installed here. The contributor skill is written
# here and tracked, so it is the one negation. The `/*` matters: git cannot
# re-include anything under a directory that is itself ignored.
/.agents/
/.claude/skills/*
!/.claude/skills/theoria-dev/
